the bootstrap settings are the first records, in their resolution order: true
the profile picked on the commandline is recorded with its argv element: true
a commandline setting is recorded once, with the argv element that stated it: true
a commandline record renders its argv element as the origin, and its source as its layer: true
a typed getter's read is recorded, the profile value under the level that picked it: true
every config-file record names, as its origin, a file stating exactly that key=value: true
a default read and then a changed resolution are two records, the change last: true
reading the records records nothing: true
Rendered records:
{"ocannl_config":1,"key":"debug_highlight_pcre","value":"a\"b\\c\u0009d\u000ae\u0001f","source":"commandline","layer":"commandline","profile":null,"origin":"--ocannl_debug_highlight_pcre=a\"b"}
{"ocannl_config":1,"key":"debug_highlight_pcre","value":"x, commandline y","source":"commandline","layer":"commandline","profile":null,"origin":"--ocannl_debug_highlight_pcre=x, commandline y"}
{"ocannl_config":1,"key":"debug_highlight_pcre","value":"zażółć","source":"environment","layer":"environment","profile":null,"origin":"OCANNL_DEBUG_HIGHLIGHT_PCRE"}
{"ocannl_config":1,"key":"debug_highlight_pcre","value":"","source":"default","layer":"default","profile":null,"origin":null}
{"ocannl_config":1,"key":"debug_highlight_pcre","value":"true","source":"profile","layer":"commandline","profile":"approximate","origin":"--ocannl_profile=approximate"}
every rendered record is one line, free of control characters: true
